{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_wi5g24otpmtyd4eiu36pc2nsr7w6fic46qi7tjhmrhdmzbqnoqwa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01S65rJJpugpDt77hcqd3R3E","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-DKQYPQ/translation/src/lib.rs","old_string":"/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n * Public ABI\n * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n\n/// Parse the input text to generate a number, and populate the result into item.","new_string":"/// Faithful equivalent of the C statement `item->FIELD = VALUE;`.\n///\n/// The C performs **no** `item != NULL` check (lib.c:92 stores straight through\n/// the parameter), and that missing check is a behaviour we must reproduce, not\n/// fix. Writing it in Rust as the place expression `(*item).FIELD = VALUE`ncompiles\n/// to the same plain store *only* when UB checks are off; under\n/// `-C debug-assertions` (which Cargo's `dev` profile enables by default) rustc\n/// additionally emits a null-pointer-dereference check, so a NULL `item` aborts\n/// with a Rust panic (SIGABRT + a message on stderr) where the C raises SIGSEGV.\n///\n/// `addr_of_mut!` computes the field's address *without* dereferencing, and\n/// `ptr::write` performs exactly the same plain, non-volatile, non-atomic store\n/// the C does — so a NULL `item` faults with SIGSEGV at the identical address in\n/// every profile, matching the C build byte for byte.\nmacro_rules! item_store {\n    ($item:expr, $field:ident, $value:expr) => {\n        unsafe { core::ptr::write(core::ptr::addr_of_mut!((*$item).$field), $value) }\n    };\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n * Public ABI\n * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n\n/// Parse the input text to generate a number, and populate the result into item."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2308,"cache_read_input_tokens":163482,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2308,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9357c047-74df-4249-854b-1bf85b7adbcd","uuid":"b76dbdb4-e27e-41e7-adcd-bde39eaaf9d0","timestamp":"2026-08-27T13:12:07.175Z"}
